{
  "document": {
    "format": "deckweft-presentation",
    "schemaVersion": 3,
    "id": "visual-wave-a-zh-CN",
    "title": "让想法拥有更鲜明的舞台",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "cover-title",
        "type": "heading",
        "sourceIds": [
          "synthetic-source"
        ],
        "text": "让大胆的想法\n拥有自己的舞台。"
      },
      {
        "id": "cover-body",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "sourceIds": [
          "synthetic-source"
        ],
        "text": "内容是起点，构图让它拥有声音。保留可编辑的文字，让每一种视觉选择都有明确的理由。"
      },
      {
        "id": "cover-metric",
        "type": "metric",
        "sourceIds": [
          "synthetic-source"
        ],
        "value": 12,
        "unit": "页",
        "label": "合成样例简报，等待逐页探索。"
      },
      {
        "id": "cover-note",
        "type": "callout",
        "sourceIds": [
          "synthetic-source"
        ],
        "text": "01 / 从文字走向视觉"
      },
      {
        "id": "cover-source",
        "type": "citation",
        "sourceIds": [
          "synthetic-source"
        ],
        "sourceId": "synthetic-source",
        "text": "固定样例内容 · 不代表产品成果"
      },
      {
        "id": "data-title",
        "type": "heading",
        "sourceIds": [
          "synthetic-source"
        ],
        "text": "两条路径，\n让差异清晰可见。"
      },
      {
        "id": "data-chart",
        "type": "chart",
        "sourceIds": [
          "synthetic-source"
        ],
        "datasetId": "adoption-quarterly"
      },
      {
        "id": "data-callout",
        "type": "callout",
        "sourceIds": [
          "synthetic-source"
        ],
        "text": "让证据始终可见。"
      },
      {
        "id": "data-body",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "sourceIds": [
          "synthetic-source"
        ],
        "text": "在同一尺度下比较两组数据。下表保留每一个精确数值。这些数字是合成演示数据，并非真实产品成效。"
      },
      {
        "id": "data-source",
        "type": "citation",
        "sourceIds": [
          "synthetic-source"
        ],
        "sourceId": "synthetic-source",
        "text": "合成季度数据集 · 单位：%"
      },
      {
        "id": "violet-title",
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "让好故事，\n值得靠近。",
        "sourceIds": [
          "synthetic-source"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "violet-body",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "让图像拥有空间，让表达保持清楚。鲜明的视觉语言，也可以保留每一句可编辑的文字。",
        "sourceIds": [
          "synthetic-source"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "violet-image",
        "type": "image",
        "assetId": "asset_70c32da27c9df448e0749ce3",
        "alt": "生成的装饰性工作桌插画：纸卡与蓝色线轴。",
        "factual": false,
        "sourceIds": [
          "synthetic-source"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "violet-caption",
        "type": "callout",
        "text": "装饰性生成插画 / 原有本地素材",
        "sourceIds": [
          "synthetic-source"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "chapter-title",
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "表达可以改变。\n事实始终保留。",
        "sourceIds": [
          "synthetic-source"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "chapter-body",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "整页紫色，给叙事一次有意的停顿。切换主题时，保留内容、数值、引用与作者锁定。",
        "sourceIds": [
          "synthetic-source"
        ]
      }
    ],
